# qwen3.5:9b — role orchestration order

Sequential, not parallel: work ONE role at a time, in this order, only
moving to the next once the current role is Closed (or explicitly
judged not-worth-continuing, same as any AGENTS.md role verdict).

1. reasoner    (~/claude-remote/roles/reasoner/)
2. extract     (~/claude-remote/roles/extract/)
3. tooluse     (~/claude-remote/roles/tooluse/)
4. review      (~/claude-remote/roles/review/)
5. codeemitter (~/claude-remote/roles/codeemitter/)

Each role directory has its own inbox.md (role-specific instructions,
checked first), roadmap.md (detailed progress + Status line), and
status.md (per-run log). Documenter is already closed - not in this
list, see models/qwen3.5-9b/README.md.

To find the active role: read this file's order, then check each
role's roadmap.md Status line in order - the active role is the first
one whose Status is not "Closed".
